  "question": "Where is restaurant found within 70 kilometers while moving toward Texas Tech University Health Sciences Center at the Permian Basin, Odessa, TX from I-20 Wildlife Preserve, Midland, TX?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-102.120752 31.962885)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-102.376579 31.844)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-102.120752 31.962885)',4326)::geography, 70000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-102.120752 31.962885)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
